//@version=6
indicator("UCTPROBE_VW_FILL_HIDDEN_ANCHORS", overlay = true)

// PROVENANCE: written 2026-11-19 (Q-FILL-HID-1, docs/pine/capture-queue-2026-11-19-hline-fill.md). Our probe.
// NEVER COMPILED ON TRADINGVIEW.
//
// ─── A FILL BETWEEN ANCHORS THE AUTHOR HID: THE SHAPE THE ENGINE REFUSES AS `pine:hidden-only` ───
//
// When every output that translates is a series the author hid (`display = display.none`, or an untitled `fill()`
// anchor), the engine offers no column (`pine:hidden-only`, ruling 1.2), and what the pane may DRAW for such a script
// has no capture: the fill between two hidden anchors, and whether an untitled anchor with no `display` argument is
// drawn as a line (engine 75 measured `display: 15` for one such anchor; this probe asks for the pair, untitled and
// hidden side by side). Every row is drawn on the price chart.
//
//   A1 / A2      high / low, untitled, display.none        → F1 between them, color.new(color.teal, 80)
//   B1 / B2      hl2 / ohlc4, untitled, no `display` given → F2 between them, color.new(color.orange, 70)
//   C1 / C2      open (untitled, display.none) / close (untitled, no `display`) → F3, color.new(color.purple, 85)
// CAPTURE: NYSE:RDDT 1D from the listing, inputs at defaults; record styles / styleState (each anchor's `display` /
// `visible`), filledAreas / filledAreaDefaults / filledAreaState (each fill's colour), and the plotted values.

a1 = plot(high, display = display.none)
a2 = plot(low, display = display.none)
fill(a1, a2, color = color.new(color.teal, 80), title = "F1_hidden_hidden")
b1 = plot(hl2)
b2 = plot(ohlc4)
fill(b1, b2, color = color.new(color.orange, 70), title = "F2_untitled_untitled")
c1 = plot(open, display = display.none)
c2 = plot(close)
fill(c1, c2, color = color.new(color.purple, 85), title = "F3_hidden_untitled")
